{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51665","headline":"题得铜香炉（幷序） · 钱元瓘","name":"题得铜香炉（幷序）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫记年华隐水中，忽於此日覩灵踪。\n三天瑞气标金相，五色龙光俨圣容。\n节届初秋兴典教，时当千载庆遭逢。\n仙冠羽服声清曲，共引金台入九重。\n（以上《吴越钱氏传芳集》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱元瓘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51665.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51665","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}